\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The heavens declare Thy glory, Lord,
\par In every star Thy wisdom shines;
\par But when our eyes behold Thy word
\par We read Thy name and fairer lines.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The rolling sun, the changing light
\par And night and day, Thy power confess; 
\par But the blest volume Thou hast writ
\par Reveals Thy justice and Thy grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Sun, moon, and stars convey Thy praise
\par Round the whole earth, and never stand;
\par So when Thy truth began its race,
\par It touched and glanced on every land.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Nor shall Thy spreading gospel rest
\par Till through the world Thy truth has rung;
\par Till Christ has all the nations blest,
\par That see the light or feel the sun.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Great Sun of Righteousness, arise,
\par Bless the dark world with heavenly light;
\par Thy gospel makes the simple wise;
\par Thy laws are pure, Thy judgements right.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Thy noblest wonders here we view,
\par In souls renewed, and sins forgiven;
\par Lord, cleanse my sins, my soul renew,
\par And make Thy word my guide in heaven.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

